      overview: "The author explains the Qard (loan) vs Dayn (debt) distinction, states the core rule that only the principal may be recovered, and shows how ownership/risk transfer differs across sale (Bai'), loan (Qard) and lease (Ijarah) — the key to telling legitimate profit from Riba.",
